-- src:14962 | 155A(1), 155C(1) or 155D(1), or by a disqualification
-- src:14963 | order made by the Court under section 149, 149A or 154(2)
-- src:14964 | (whether or not the company becomes aware of that fact
-- src:14965 | due to the person notifying the company of that fact in
